From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS Curium: drop AI, Lens, voice, and Discover entry points

Remove the AIM navigation observer, Lens browser and navigation hooks,
voice navigation observer, and Discover refresh and app agents. Keep the
Discover visibility and provider interfaces used by Chrome UI fallbacks.
Use the Gemini kill switch and send ordinary text entry to the existing
omnibox instead of starting Composebox or contextual search.

Default iOS segmentation and its UKM database off. Return Chromium's dummy
service on the disabled path so callers can still receive results. Keep
visited-URL ranking active without its segmentation metrics transform.

